{"seq":1,"slug":"integration-patterns","title":"Integration Patterns","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/integration-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agent-to-tool-bridges","title":"Agent 到工具的桥接方式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/integration-patterns/agent-to-tool-bridges","wordCount":2426,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"event-driven-triggers","title":"事件驱动的触发","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/integration-patterns/event-driven-triggers","wordCount":2485,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"bidirectional-sync","title":"双向同步与状态一致","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/bridges/workflow-tool-integration/integration-patterns/bidirectional-sync","wordCount":2648,"readingTime":11}],"introMarkdown":"把 agent 桥接进既有工作流，归根结底只有三类基础模式：让 agent 触达工具的「工具桥」、让事件代替人来唤起 agent 的「事件触发」、以及 agent 与外部系统互相读写时的「双向同步」。本章逐一拆解这三类模式的通道选择、运行纪律与状态一致性问题，并给出个人尺度下可直接照搬的配方。理解这三块之后，任何新工具的接入都只是模式的重新组合。\n"}